{"description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "\"Avenge us,\" wrote my father. His last words. And I promised him, fists raised to heaven after his brutal disappearance. I was going to avenge my brother, dead as a workman. To avenge my father, who had left as a peasant. To avenge my mother, lonely for ever. I was going to punish the Houillères, and all the bastards who had never paid for their crimes.--Translation of page 4 of cover by Babelio."}, "title": "Le jour d'avant", "subtitle": "roman", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL277802A"}], "publish_date": "2017", "links": [{"url": "http://i1382.photobucket.com/albums/ah249/CMA2016/eplstockimage_worldlanguagebook_zpsunvaw0go.jpg"}], "isbn_10": ["2246813808"], "lc_classifications": ["PQ2663.H2615 J68 2017"], "isbn_13": ["9782246813804"], "pagination": "331 pages", "source_records": ["marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run06.mrc:83692867:2142", "promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-03-17", "marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-026.mrc:68870493:732", "ia:lejourdavantroma0000chal", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_031.bib.mrc:137368804:1580"], "dewey_decimal_class": ["843/.914"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/fre"}], "lccn": ["2017438513"], "local_id": ["urn:sfpl:31223124570681", "urn:bwbsku:T2-CEF-865"], "publish_country": "fr", "by_statement": "Sorj Chalandon", "oclc_numbers": ["1001304862"], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "ocaid": "lejourdavantroma0000chal", "key": "/books/OL26943483M", "number_of_pages": 331, "works": [{"key": "/works/OL19730383W"}], "covers": [14489079], "publishers": ["Bernard Grasset"], "latest_revision": 6, "revision": 6, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2019-05-24T03:04:35.165274"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-02-16T15:42:23.361259"}}